{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 8459709410733667918,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Writing LLM-created code",
      "source_hash": 9670881618274374106,
      "context_hash": 3553288699781389999,
      "translation": "LLM이 작성한 코드 작성하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853072Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "LLMs are a valuable tool, but one that is easy to misuse.",
      "source_hash": 15968633659235387880,
      "context_hash": 8263852865063429840,
      "translation": "LLM은 유용한 도구이지만 오용하기도 쉽습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The main risks are **overwhelming volume** and **lack of understanding**.",
      "source_hash": 9781304442811313059,
      "context_hash": 8473878224882397414,
      "translation": "주된 위험은 **압도적인 양**과 **이해 부족**입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "When writing your PR, keep in mind that there is a person on the other end who needs to review and understand your change, and that other people in the project will need to read your code for years to come.",
      "source_hash": 1986967064378022253,
      "context_hash": 4238149683098719676,
      "translation": "PR을 작성할 때는, 반대편에는 여러분의 변경 사항을 검토하고 이해해야 하는 사람이 있으며, 프로젝트의 다른 사람들도 앞으로 수년간 여러분의 코드를 읽어야 한다는 점을 명심하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "Help us out by making your change small, targeted, and high-quality.",
      "source_hash": 2293819268666307547,
      "context_hash": 5481329363400232993,
      "translation": "변경 사항을 작고, 목표가 명확하며, 고품질로 만들어서 저희를 도와주십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Keep in mind this quote:",
      "source_hash": 17519486497793754787,
      "context_hash": 11639455697644906407,
      "translation": "다음 인용문을 명심하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Programs must be written for people to read, and only incidentally for machines to execute. — Harold Abelson and Gerald Jay Sussman, [*Structure and Interpretation of Computer Programs*][sicp]",
      "source_hash": 15132171769065296716,
      "context_hash": 5492397933209288872,
      "translation": "프로그램은 사람이 읽도록 작성되어야 하며, 기계가 실행하는 것은 부수적일 뿐입니다. — Harold Abelson, Gerald Jay Sussman, [*Structure and Interpretation of Computer Programs*][sicp]",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Rules",
      "source_hash": 16019270039733832109,
      "context_hash": 8497190832878803618,
      "translation": "규칙",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Before you write code",
      "source_hash": 7674226779822306954,
      "context_hash": 12002669306947519165,
      "translation": "코드를 작성하기 전에",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Before anything else, find a reviewer who volunteers to review your PR.",
      "source_hash": 2970838582094471011,
      "context_hash": 6339045469630852940,
      "translation": "무엇보다도 먼저, PR을 검토해 줄 자원한 리뷰어를 찾으십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "If you do not know where to find a reviewer, ask in [#llm-mentoring] on Zulip.",
      "source_hash": 16647184900121204230,
      "context_hash": 5793266867026933954,
      "translation": "리뷰어를 어디서 찾아야 할지 모르겠다면, Zulip의 [#llm-mentoring]에서 문의하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "Your first message should say:",
      "source_hash": 420473861654991169,
      "context_hash": 11806280205084541971,
      "translation": "첫 메시지에는 다음 내용이 포함되어야 합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853074Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "your relevant experience, so we can find an issue that's suitable for you",
      "source_hash": 972888474909929618,
      "context_hash": 6305563374507945486,
      "translation": "여러분에게 적합한 이슈를 찾을 수 있도록, 관련 경험",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853074Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "which problem (or kind of problem) you want to work on",
      "source_hash": 2342508585417934301,
      "context_hash": 8040439566617046939,
      "translation": "작업하고 싶은 문제(또는 문제의 종류)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853074Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "(optional) ideas you have so far for a solution",
      "source_hash": 17220773765203683150,
      "context_hash": 4331652639995020694,
      "translation": "(선택 사항) 지금까지 생각해 둔 해결 아이디어",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853074Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "(optional) how you expect to test your solution",
      "source_hash": 4374398243924595319,
      "context_hash": 640983854286235047,
      "translation": "(선택 사항) 해결책을 테스트할 예정인 방법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853074Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Mentors are here to help.",
      "source_hash": 1420817357673285322,
      "context_hash": 5233476798182968867,
      "translation": "멘토들은 여러분을 돕기 위해 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853074Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:1",
      "source": "Talking to them early helps you avoid wasted work.",
      "source_hash": 13158746951687315610,
      "context_hash": 16262230938301186584,
      "translation": "일찍 그들과 대화하면 헛수고를 피하는 데 도움이 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853074Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "While working",
      "source_hash": 16544500954835453394,
      "context_hash": 5802589890024503883,
      "translation": "작업하는 동안",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853074Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Write your own doc-comments, `// SAFETY` comments, diagnostic wording, and soundness-critical code.",
      "source_hash": 14350149412893955095,
      "context_hash": 4916052238797471503,
      "translation": "문서 주석(doc-comment), `// SAFETY` 주석, 진단 문구, 그리고 건전성에 중요한(soundness-critical) 코드는 직접 작성하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853074Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:1",
      "source": "As before, you can use an LLM to review your work, but not to write it from scratch.",
      "source_hash": 17458273055444916284,
      "context_hash": 16097070895459733736,
      "translation": "앞서와 마찬가지로, LLM을 사용해 여러분이 작성한 것을 검토할 수는 있지만, 처음부터 작성하게 해서는 안 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853074Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:2",
      "source": "If you don't know what counts as soundness-critical, discuss it with your reviewer.",
      "source_hash": 14689173009024780955,
      "context_hash": 16030768921992937170,
      "translation": "무엇이 건전성에 중요한(soundness-critical) 것으로 간주되는지 모르겠다면, 리뷰어와 논의하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853074Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "When opening a PR",
      "source_hash": 5108785684344274543,
      "context_hash": 10369875269744361685,
      "translation": "PR을 열 때",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853075Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Disclose your use of LLMs, following the disclosure guidelines below.",
      "source_hash": 11311713793117527130,
      "context_hash": 1649605403189971938,
      "translation": "아래의 공개 가이드라인에 따라, LLM 사용 여부를 공개하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853075Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:1",
      "source": "Write the disclosure yourself.",
      "source_hash": 12478049271541410806,
      "context_hash": 297682939042963087,
      "translation": "공개 내용은 직접 작성하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853075Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:2",
      "source": "You may use an LLM to privately review a disclosure you have written, but not to draft or rewrite it.",
      "source_hash": 9529854208806380360,
      "context_hash": 6953217514900830588,
      "translation": "여러분이 작성한 공개 내용을 비공개로 LLM에게 검토받을 수는 있지만, 초안 작성이나 재작성을 맡길 수는 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853075Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "**Write your own PR description and comments**.",
      "source_hash": 11592444343741538513,
      "context_hash": 17198650065563937823,
      "translation": "**PR 설명과 댓글은 직접 작성하십시오**.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853075Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:12/seg:1",
      "source": "We want to hear from you, not from your agent.",
      "source_hash": 2878554965199239369,
      "context_hash": 2889770207496082656,
      "translation": "저희는 여러분의 에이전트가 아니라 여러분에게서 이야기를 듣고 싶습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853075Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:12/seg:2",
      "source": "LLM-created PR descriptions are banned.",
      "source_hash": 16705956510478596757,
      "context_hash": 17818003277757554255,
      "translation": "LLM이 작성한 PR 설명은 금지됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853075Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:12/seg:3",
      "source": "LLM-created GitHub comments are banned.",
      "source_hash": 1345112262693135692,
      "context_hash": 6212013574520837303,
      "translation": "LLM이 작성한 GitHub 댓글은 금지됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853075Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Guidelines",
      "source_hash": 99987468540432321,
      "context_hash": 15299152419686989755,
      "translation": "가이드라인",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853075Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Before you write code",
      "source_hash": 7674226779822306954,
      "context_hash": 16971664896333706024,
      "translation": "코드를 작성하기 전에",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:24.853075Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Start with one PR at a time.",
      "source_hash": 6464025822399600335,
      "context_hash": 9011969547820679628,
      "translation": "한 번에 하나의 PR로 시작하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105106Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Keep your changes small enough that you and your reviewer can understand every part of them.",
      "source_hash": 8908606801356826124,
      "context_hash": 16450512935175556495,
      "translation": "변경 사항의 모든 부분을 본인과 리뷰어가 이해할 수 있을 만큼 작게 유지하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "Go slow.",
      "source_hash": 18176648001987814754,
      "context_hash": 9943384324755574580,
      "translation": "천천히 진행하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Do not use an LLM for `E-easy` issues; those are meant for you to write the code yourself.",
      "source_hash": 17110935107465323066,
      "context_hash": 7764755179061400081,
      "translation": "`E-easy` 이슈에는 LLM을 사용하지 마십시오. 이러한 이슈는 여러분이 직접 코드를 작성하도록 마련된 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Ask first before working on an `E-mentor` issue; mentors may not want to work with LLM-generated code.",
      "source_hash": 1100591535739171934,
      "context_hash": 14075177126431701554,
      "translation": "`E-mentor` 이슈 작업을 시작하기 전에는 먼저 문의하십시오. 멘토가 LLM이 생성한 코드로 작업하는 것을 원하지 않을 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Determine whether this is a *useful* and *well-scoped* change.",
      "source_hash": 18245901489786635708,
      "context_hash": 6579376893717336406,
      "translation": "이것이 *유용하고* *범위가 적절한* 변경인지 판단하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "For example:",
      "source_hash": 4114854479619665730,
      "context_hash": 8857405695989286015,
      "translation": "예를 들면:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Search for related issues and PRs.",
      "source_hash": 15444269977956222864,
      "context_hash": 5566734678744816469,
      "translation": "관련 이슈와 PR을 검색하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Find relevant code, tests, git history, and Zulip discussion.",
      "source_hash": 14429339212992705014,
      "context_hash": 1182381384370814923,
      "translation": "관련된 코드, 테스트, git 히스토리, Zulip 논의를 찾으십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "If this is a cross-cutting change, consult the [pull request guidance](../getting-started.md#pull-requests).",
      "source_hash": 18098380137092921636,
      "context_hash": 12956845356800852070,
      "translation": "이것이 여러 영역에 걸친 변경이라면 [pull request guidance](../getting-started.md#pull-requests)를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "[Make the smallest change that fixes the problem][small-cls].",
      "source_hash": 15560802002667764228,
      "context_hash": 5372735203477697174,
      "translation": "[문제를 해결하는 가장 작은 변경을 만드십시오][small-cls].",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:8/seg:1",
      "source": "Do not combine it with unrelated refactors or cleanups.",
      "source_hash": 17426060850765239258,
      "context_hash": 7140325654463119305,
      "translation": "관련 없는 리팩터링이나 정리 작업과 결합하지 마십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "While working",
      "source_hash": 16544500954835453394,
      "context_hash": 4621561916707108281,
      "translation": "작업 중",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "When fixing a bug, verify that your test fails before and succeeds after your change.",
      "source_hash": 5753189983921875643,
      "context_hash": 16019779522655886395,
      "translation": "버그를 수정할 때는 변경 전에 테스트가 실패하고 변경 후에 성공하는지 확인하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:10/seg:1",
      "source": "Consult [adding new tests](../tests/adding.md) and [best practices](../tests/best-practices.md) for test procedures.",
      "source_hash": 3593747306212249549,
      "context_hash": 2503739757372618450,
      "translation": "테스트 절차에 대해서는 [adding new tests](../tests/adding.md)와 [best practices](../tests/best-practices.md)를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:10/seg:2",
      "source": "Tests are absolutely required; either existing tests or new tests you write.",
      "source_hash": 5258843142343485826,
      "context_hash": 18187141278878336188,
      "translation": "테스트는 반드시 필요합니다. 기존 테스트든 여러분이 새로 작성한 테스트든 상관없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:10/seg:3",
      "source": "Untested LLM PRs will not be merged.",
      "source_hash": 2833859508729664517,
      "context_hash": 7277555800150869185,
      "translation": "테스트되지 않은 LLM PR은 병합되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105108Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Mass renames or rewrites should *strongly* prefer using a proper syntax rewrite tool, such as [`ast-grep`].",
      "source_hash": 11497167025849786556,
      "context_hash": 3447817487548453304,
      "translation": "대규모 이름 변경이나 재작성 작업에는 [`ast-grep`]과 같은 적절한 구문 재작성 도구 사용을 *강력히* 선호해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105108Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:11/seg:1",
      "source": "You may use an LLM for generating the instructions for that tool, but you should be very cautious about performing the rewrite directly with an LLM.",
      "source_hash": 1262259238129437301,
      "context_hash": 10553514368933054106,
      "translation": "해당 도구에 대한 지시문을 생성하는 데는 LLM을 사용해도 되지만, LLM으로 직접 재작성을 수행하는 것에는 매우 신중해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105108Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "Consider [performance] as you write.",
      "source_hash": 15581809918688711762,
      "context_hash": 2530634896613101930,
      "translation": "작성하면서 [performance]를 고려하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105108Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "Think before adding dependencies; consult our [guidance for new dependencies][crates-io].",
      "source_hash": 17769744279092066553,
      "context_hash": 6162070498621945922,
      "translation": "의존성을 추가하기 전에 생각해 보십시오. [guidance for new dependencies][crates-io]를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105108Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "Verify your understanding against the existing code, documentation, and tests.",
      "source_hash": 13969143355187985873,
      "context_hash": 1130799990003910265,
      "translation": "기존 코드, 문서, 테스트에 비추어 여러분의 이해를 검증하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105108Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:14/seg:1",
      "source": "You can get better advice from your LLM by telling *it* to read the relevant materials.",
      "source_hash": 13502270241048013301,
      "context_hash": 12822975166274382443,
      "translation": "*LLM*에게 관련 자료를 읽도록 지시하면 더 나은 조언을 얻을 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105108Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:14/seg:2",
      "source": "Do not rely on the LLM as a source of truth.",
      "source_hash": 16989971673175987348,
      "context_hash": 7090453023206868703,
      "translation": "LLM을 진실의 원천으로 의존하지 마십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105108Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "Write maintainable code",
      "source_hash": 16291968446841760513,
      "context_hash": 14488173958415925062,
      "translation": "유지보수 가능한 코드 작성하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105108Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "Treat generated code as a *draft*, not a final product.",
      "source_hash": 16384665802841159266,
      "context_hash": 14706854829116424549,
      "translation": "생성된 코드를 최종 산출물이 아니라 *초안*으로 취급하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105108Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:16/seg:1",
      "source": "Follow our [correctness and maintainability conventions](../conventions.md#cc).",
      "source_hash": 2496712673955502134,
      "context_hash": 16203310955415896465,
      "translation": "저희의 [correctness and maintainability conventions](../conventions.md#cc)를 따르십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105108Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "Avoid unnecessary abstractions and compatibility layers.",
      "source_hash": 15111242614227850304,
      "context_hash": 5164735384191726355,
      "translation": "불필요한 추상화와 호환성 계층을 피하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105108Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:17/seg:1",
      "source": "Rustc does not have a stable API; you do not need to preserve backwards compatibility for internal compiler APIs.",
      "source_hash": 13780295265590120237,
      "context_hash": 4139120641344407832,
      "translation": "Rustc는 안정된 API를 가지고 있지 않습니다. 내부 컴파일러 API에 대해 하위 호환성을 유지할 필요는 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105108Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "Commit structure",
      "source_hash": 6852561585066457494,
      "context_hash": 1167297794711133503,
      "translation": "커밋 구조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105108Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:19/seg:0",
      "source": "See [\"How to structure your PR\"](../contributing.md#er).",
      "source_hash": 17470725639165285886,
      "context_hash": 8779149834715797224,
      "translation": "[\"How to structure your PR\"](../contributing.md#er)를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105108Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:19/seg:1",
      "source": "Commit messages must be authored by you, not your LLM.",
      "source_hash": 8469300729801564944,
      "context_hash": 13725300612878003580,
      "translation": "커밋 메시지는 LLM이 아니라 여러분 본인이 작성해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:32.105109Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:20/seg:0",
      "source": "Before opening a PR",
      "source_hash": 16546409859482946906,
      "context_hash": 6808537773141678281,
      "translation": "PR을 열기 전에",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122724Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:21/seg:0",
      "source": "Review your own PR before opening it: Does it make sense?",
      "source_hash": 1844359619273798901,
      "context_hash": 13881168314276853975,
      "translation": "PR을 열기 전에 직접 검토하십시오: 말이 됩니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122725Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:21/seg:1",
      "source": "Can you tell what the goal of the PR is?",
      "source_hash": 14330923844556928780,
      "context_hash": 1668452555193088406,
      "translation": "PR의 목표가 무엇인지 알 수 있습니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122725Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:21/seg:2",
      "source": "Does it achieve that goal?",
      "source_hash": 9193400461896883961,
      "context_hash": 10327019694415087609,
      "translation": "그 목표를 달성했습니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122725Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:22/seg:0",
      "source": "Remove outdated or prototyping code and debugging.",
      "source_hash": 13738316370750516164,
      "context_hash": 3093811203250434441,
      "translation": "오래된 코드나 프로토타이핑 코드, 디버깅 코드를 제거하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122725Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:23/seg:0",
      "source": "Re-read the whole diff, *not* just your conversation with the agent.",
      "source_hash": 9187455492002201691,
      "context_hash": 3040541113007648490,
      "translation": "에이전트와의 대화가 *아니라* 전체 diff를 다시 읽으십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122725Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:23/seg:1",
      "source": "Your reviewer is going to see your code, not your conversation.",
      "source_hash": 1300179020586790140,
      "context_hash": 7718534557084452200,
      "translation": "검토자는 여러분의 대화가 아니라 코드를 보게 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122725Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:24/seg:0",
      "source": "[Run tests](../tests/running.md) to verify your change works.",
      "source_hash": 13987939652840312774,
      "context_hash": 118432205102672303,
      "translation": "변경 사항이 작동하는지 확인하기 위해 [테스트를 실행](../tests/running.md)하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122725Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:24/seg:1",
      "source": "Do NOT report which UI tests you ran in the PR description; that's noise, since CI will run them anyway.",
      "source_hash": 1979370864764078647,
      "context_hash": 11623944390845873213,
      "translation": "어떤 UI 테스트를 실행했는지 PR 설명에 기재하지 마십시오. CI가 어차피 이를 실행할 것이므로 이는 불필요한 정보입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122725Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:24/seg:2",
      "source": "If you did manual testing or benchmarking, do report that, but note that all LLM PRs must have automated tests.",
      "source_hash": 9538913648097979170,
      "context_hash": 15957134122953694360,
      "translation": "수동 테스트나 벤치마킹을 수행했다면 이를 기재하되, 모든 LLM PR은 자동화된 테스트를 갖추어야 함에 유의하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122725Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:25/seg:0",
      "source": "[Review diagnostic snapshots](../tests/adding.md#step-4-review-the-output); don't simply `--bless` them away.",
      "source_hash": 9057011487444898016,
      "context_hash": 11025008339305697045,
      "translation": "[진단 스냅샷을 검토](../tests/adding.md#step-4-review-the-output)하십시오. 단순히 `--bless`로 무마하지 마십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122725Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:26/seg:0",
      "source": "We recommend using a different model for adversarial local review before publishing your changes.",
      "source_hash": 9220771135325567498,
      "context_hash": 8564152760167562126,
      "translation": "변경 사항을 게시하기 전에 적대적 로컬 검토를 위해 다른 모델을 사용하는 것을 권장합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122726Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:26/seg:1",
      "source": "You're still responsible for reviewing your own changes yourself.",
      "source_hash": 5473888309573657017,
      "context_hash": 16383751748457844830,
      "translation": "그럼에도 자신의 변경 사항을 스스로 검토할 책임은 여전히 여러분에게 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122726Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:27/seg:0",
      "source": "Understand your own change",
      "source_hash": 18416041014252596296,
      "context_hash": 16742832003378351475,
      "translation": "자신의 변경 사항을 이해하십시오",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122726Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:28/seg:0",
      "source": "We want you to understand and be able to explain your own change and its edge cases.",
      "source_hash": 17048214148987647598,
      "context_hash": 13226571327908887261,
      "translation": "여러분이 자신의 변경 사항과 그 경계 사례를 이해하고 설명할 수 있기를 바랍니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122726Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:28/seg:1",
      "source": "Asking the LLM can be a starting point but it's not the same as explaining it yourself.",
      "source_hash": 3342588822462038982,
      "context_hash": 6753896313191547756,
      "translation": "LLM에게 물어보는 것이 출발점이 될 수는 있지만, 스스로 설명하는 것과는 다릅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122726Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:29/seg:0",
      "source": "Try explaining your change to yourself before opening the PR.",
      "source_hash": 2536158831729295751,
      "context_hash": 12677847307178386520,
      "translation": "PR을 열기 전에 스스로에게 변경 사항을 설명해 보십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122726Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:29/seg:1",
      "source": "For example, ask yourself:",
      "source_hash": 826952532418763267,
      "context_hash": 8066631239389941400,
      "translation": "예를 들어, 스스로에게 다음을 물어보십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122726Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:30/seg:0",
      "source": "What is the original bug?",
      "source_hash": 6367966147349812289,
      "context_hash": 3519582866453595894,
      "translation": "원래 버그는 무엇입니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122726Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:30/seg:1",
      "source": "When does it happen?",
      "source_hash": 352838290992200719,
      "context_hash": 16983228811656699643,
      "translation": "언제 발생합니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122726Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:30/seg:2",
      "source": "How severe is it?",
      "source_hash": 16765046877029853607,
      "context_hash": 10731865914761507455,
      "translation": "얼마나 심각합니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122727Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:30/seg:3",
      "source": "What causes it?",
      "source_hash": 13968167162959884483,
      "context_hash": 15225449938501893203,
      "translation": "무엇이 이를 유발합니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122727Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:31/seg:0",
      "source": "Why is this the right fix?",
      "source_hash": 3743779803836054977,
      "context_hash": 13358875171996206235,
      "translation": "왜 이것이 올바른 수정입니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122727Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:31/seg:1",
      "source": "Are there other fixes possible?",
      "source_hash": 11344669608089529712,
      "context_hash": 17391508635746484324,
      "translation": "다른 수정 방법이 가능합니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122727Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:31/seg:2",
      "source": "What are their advantages or disadvantages?",
      "source_hash": 18053216096614495498,
      "context_hash": 11626084815386334597,
      "translation": "그것들의 장단점은 무엇입니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122727Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:32/seg:0",
      "source": "Are there any edge cases?",
      "source_hash": 13664463213207509747,
      "context_hash": 3350408497420433280,
      "translation": "경계 사례가 있습니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122727Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:32/seg:1",
      "source": "Does your code handle them?",
      "source_hash": 4610528213086016868,
      "context_hash": 3614731959704444290,
      "translation": "여러분의 코드가 이를 처리합니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122727Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:33/seg:0",
      "source": "Does the code have existing [invariants](https://brooker.co.za/blog/2023/07/28/ds-testing.html)?",
      "source_hash": 7841390157990057009,
      "context_hash": 2606786959948742693,
      "translation": "코드에 기존 [불변 조건](https://brooker.co.za/blog/2023/07/28/ds-testing.html)이 있습니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122727Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:33/seg:1",
      "source": "Did you preserve those invariants?",
      "source_hash": 2667865952247292851,
      "context_hash": 8308027952536244015,
      "translation": "그 불변 조건을 보존했습니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122727Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:34/seg:0",
      "source": "What behavior is *unchanged*?",
      "source_hash": 15289108342030961523,
      "context_hash": 13432459664783655764,
      "translation": "변경되지 *않은* 동작은 무엇입니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122727Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:34/seg:1",
      "source": "What test establishes that?",
      "source_hash": 12503383925901192782,
      "context_hash": 15453903163283827543,
      "translation": "어떤 테스트가 이를 입증합니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122727Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:35/seg:0",
      "source": "Why does your test trigger the bug?",
      "source_hash": 6890997193134072601,
      "context_hash": 12126101256329814464,
      "translation": "여러분의 테스트가 왜 그 버그를 유발합니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:02:30.122727Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:36/seg:0",
      "source": "What are you still not certain about?",
      "source_hash": 12880116916213891781,
      "context_hash": 14898472697717829991,
      "translation": "무엇에 대해 여전히 확신이 서지 않습니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:32.085248Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:37/seg:0",
      "source": "It's ok to be uncertain and to ask for help.",
      "source_hash": 8443171840707684624,
      "context_hash": 6436589491871806305,
      "translation": "확신이 서지 않을 때는 도움을 요청해도 괜찮습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:32.085248Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:37/seg:1",
      "source": "We would much rather help you because you're not sure than have you guess wrong and then have to reverse-engineer where you went wrong.",
      "source_hash": 10348747608370772615,
      "context_hash": 1938451609282490586,
      "translation": "잘못 추측한 뒤 어디서 잘못되었는지 역추적하게 하는 것보다, 확신이 서지 않을 때 도움을 드리는 편이 훨씬 낫습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:32.085248Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:38/seg:0",
      "source": "Disclosure guidelines",
      "source_hash": 13941066005792877515,
      "context_hash": 4590638093614587097,
      "translation": "공개 지침",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:32.085248Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:39/seg:0",
      "source": "Disclose the *extent* and *purpose* of your LLM use.",
      "source_hash": 14798791764976659480,
      "context_hash": 2354207588059987062,
      "translation": "LLM 사용의 *범위*와 *목적*을 공개하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:32.085249Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:39/seg:1",
      "source": "We don't care which model you used, but we do care whether you used the LLM to implement the idea or to come up with it.",
      "source_hash": 7390914833428161123,
      "context_hash": 8733476578285015223,
      "translation": "어떤 모델을 사용했는지는 중요하지 않지만, 아이디어를 구현하는 데 LLM을 사용했는지 아니면 아이디어를 떠올리는 데 사용했는지는 중요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:32.085249Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:40/seg:0",
      "source": "**Good** examples:",
      "source_hash": 11853479157367871335,
      "context_hash": 5337138428268845679,
      "translation": "**좋은** 예:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:32.085249Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:41/seg:0",
      "source": "LLM disclosure: I wrote the three commits by hand after viewing profiling data.",
      "source_hash": 13462216368115177488,
      "context_hash": 6757936537797839591,
      "translation": "LLM 공개: 프로파일링 데이터를 확인한 후 세 개의 커밋을 직접 작성했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:32.085249Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:41/seg:1",
      "source": "I used an LLM to review the commits before submitting.",
      "source_hash": 126892770403766591,
      "context_hash": 131636041967998707,
      "translation": "제출하기 전에 LLM을 사용하여 커밋을 검토했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:32.085249Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:41/seg:2",
      "source": "The LLM identified that `ImplString::is_negative` was no longer used, so I removed that field by hand.",
      "source_hash": 14846328238223362177,
      "context_hash": 2204286783804542805,
      "translation": "LLM은 `ImplString::is_negative`가 더 이상 사용되지 않는다는 것을 확인했고, 저는 그 필드를 직접 제거했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:32.085249Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:42/seg:0",
      "source": "Created with the help of an LLM, which:",
      "source_hash": 1858620774394988488,
      "context_hash": 1137173762016758010,
      "translation": "LLM의 도움을 받아 작성했으며, LLM은 다음을 수행했습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:32.085249Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:43/seg:0",
      "source": "traced the missing cache hits to the unconditional `return(pass)` by inspecting Fastly vs CloudFront headers,",
      "source_hash": 14379767790474681730,
      "context_hash": 13427575201897659860,
      "translation": "Fastly와 CloudFront 헤더를 검사하여 무조건적인 `return(pass)`에서 캐시 히트 누락의 원인을 추적했으며,",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:32.085250Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:44/seg:0",
      "source": "reviewed the git history to understand why the snippet was added, and",
      "source_hash": 3519526155506723405,
      "context_hash": 4297877051833917411,
      "translation": "스니펫이 추가된 이유를 이해하기 위해 git 히스토리를 검토했으며,",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:32.085250Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:45/seg:0",
      "source": "made the VCL change.",
      "source_hash": 16344480906002031282,
      "context_hash": 3503221834401387888,
      "translation": "VCL 변경을 수행했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:32.085250Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:46/seg:0",
